      "itemCode": "BPSES_01",
      "en": "Even though I may not always manage it, I know what I need to do with my child",
      "zh": "即使我不一定总能做到，我也知道自己在与孩子相处时需要做什么。",
      "key": "positive",
      "assessment": "与研究文档及固定运行时一致，中文大意对应，尚待独立译审"
    },
    {
      "finalNumber": 2,
      "originalNumber": 4,
      "itemCode": "BPSES_02",
